<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title><%= content_for?(:title) ? yield(:title) : 'Acompanhamento do seu caso' %> · Ramon Antonio Advogados</title>
  <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <%# Página pública standalone fora da SPA — CSS inline permitido aqui (mock 4a, tema light da marca).
      Legibilidade 50+ (painel v2, 28/09): corpo ≥17px, botões ≥48px, cinzas escurecidos p/ contraste AA. %>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background: #faf3e8;
      color: #26211b;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .serif { font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif; }
    .portal-wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #faf3e8; min-height: 100vh; }
    .portal-header {
      padding: 16px 22px; background: #3b2a1c;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    }
    .portal-header img { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 7px; }
    .portal-header .brand-name { font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #ede0c8; }
    .portal-header .brand-sub { font-size: 13px; color: #c4a882; }
    .portal-body { padding: 22px; }
    .eyebrow { font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7d5432; }
    h1 { margin-top: 4px; font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; color: #26211b; line-height: 1.15; }
    .divider { width: 56px; height: 3px; border-radius: 99px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #754d2a, #c4a882); margin: 10px 0 18px; }
    .flash { margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 17px; }
    .flash-notice { background: #e8f3ec; color: #1f5c3d; border: 1px solid rgba(31, 92, 61, .18); }
    .flash-alert { background: #f9e9e4; color: #8a3b25; border: 1px solid rgba(138, 59, 37, .18); }
    .timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .step { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
    .step-rail { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    .step-text { padding-bottom: 16px; }
    .step:last-child .step-text { padding-bottom: 0; }
    .dot-done {
      width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: #754d2a;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .dot-current {
      width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #754d2a;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .dot-current span { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #754d2a; }
    .dot-future { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #e2d5c2; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .rail-done { width: 2px; flex: 1; background: #754d2a; min-height: 26px; }
    .rail-future { width: 2px; flex: 1; background: #e2d5c2; min-height: 26px; }
    .step-title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #26211b; }
    .step-title-future { font-size: 17px; color: #7a6b5a; }
    .step-sub { margin-top: 1px; font-size: 15px; color: #6b5c4c; }
    .pill-now {
      margin-left: 4px; padding: 2px 10px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 999px;
      background: #f5e6cc; color: #7d5432; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .docs-card {
      margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(117, 77, 42, .16);
    }
    .docs-card .docs-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #7d5432; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .docs-card ul { margin: 6px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; }
    .docs-card li { font-size: 17px; color: #3b2a1c; margin-top: 2px; }
    .docs-card .docs-hint { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 15px; color: #6b5c4c; }
    .upload-form { margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    .upload-form input[type="file"] { font-size: 16px; color: #3b2a1c; }
    .btn-bronze {
      display: inline-block; align-self: flex-start; padding: 14px 24px; min-height: 48px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center;
      border-radius: 999px; background: #754d2a; color: #fff; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-bronze:hover { background: #5f3e22; }
    .neutral-card {
      margin-top: 4px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(117, 77, 42, .16); font-size: 17px; color: #3b2a1c;
    }
    .compliance { margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #7a6b5a; }

    .form-portal { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .label { font-size: 17px; color: #4a3b2d; }
    .input { padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid #b89f7e; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 19px; background: #fff; }
    .input-codigo { letter-spacing: .4em; text-align: center; font-size: 22px; }
    .btn-link { background: none; border: 0; color: #7d5432; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 17px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-block; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 0; }
    .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e8dcc8; border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .card h2 { font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .muted { font-size: 16px; color: #6b5c4c; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 99px; background: #efe3cf; color: #7d5432; }
    .badge-novo { background: #754d2a; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
    .iframe-assinatura { width: 100%; height: 80vh; border: 0; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="portal-wrap">
    <div class="portal-header">
      <img src="/brand-assets/ramon-monogram.png" alt="RA">
      <div>
        <p class="brand-name">Ramon Antonio Advogados</p>
        <p class="brand-sub">Acompanhamento do seu caso</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="portal-body">
      <%= yield %>
      <p class="compliance">Conteúdo informativo sobre o andamento do seu atendimento. Não substitui a orientação jurídica individual de um(a) advogado(a).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
